  "description": "Designed by hugely experienced cycletourists; this is our own high quality titanium frame built to our specification with a Reynolds steel fork.\n\nThe geometry and ride is what you would expect and want from a touring bike, so that handling is reliable and assured when loaded.\n\nFull bike builds are available please call/e-mail for details.\n\nClick here to see a much larger sizing chart.\n\nClick here for suggested methods to establish the correct frame size.\n\nWe have a demonstrator of every size in stock, so please feel free to come to the shop and try one.\n\nPrice includes frame and forks. The frame's headtube and BB shell will be faced. Headset not included (Recommended headset: Cane Creek 40 External 1 1/8\"). The headset will be fitted if purchased with the frameset.\n\nDowntube Cable Stops are not included. Please order separately if required:\n\nhttps://www.spacycles.co.uk/m8b0s114p3945/SPA-CYCLES-Downtube-Cable-Stops",
